SEQUENCE:1792278972
DESCRIPTION:原文只注明单个时间，未提供有效的起止时间
 区段。原文时间：19:00；此条仅作全天提醒，不占用具体
 时间段。\n\nGrade 12 PE / Health Period 3\n\n12年级体育与健康
 课程：无需提交PAP日志。这是正式评分开始前的最后准
 备周，如有任何问题请及时询问。从起，日志将按“完
 成”或“未完成”评分。未完成每周强制性作业的学生
 ，将需要在1月中下旬补做。\n\n公告原文：\nSunday\, October
  25\, 2026 @ 7:00PM Hello class. You have NO PAP Log due this week. I gave
  you 2 weeks of "samples" and now one week to make sure you are ready and 
 incase you have any last minute questions before we start the OFFICIAL gra
 ding of Logs on\nOct 25 - this is now going to be worth a Complete or Inco
 mplete. If you do NOT complete these weekly MANDATORY assignments\, then y
 ou will be adding MAKE UP DAYS that will need to be completed in Mid to La
 te January. Thx Mr. D
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T231612Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
